+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Command line commands
+
+* `init` - creates an analysis configuration file
+* `generateReports` - generates Sokrates reports based on the analysis configuration
+* `analyzeLandscape` - creates or updates a landscape report (`<analysisRoot>/_sokrates_landscape/index.html`), aggregating results of multiple analyses; the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands
+* `updateLandscape` - the previous name of `analyzeLandscape`, still supported with the same options
+* `updateConfig` - updates an analysis configuration file and completes missing fields
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the options of a command.
\ No newline at end of file
